; The cannon minigame's own tuning, a plugin's pack: a layer of its own (the plugins
; directory in baker-project.dta), read under the plugin's name. Its scene binds
; minigames.{plugin}.gravity, so a layer above retunes this plugin's gravity alone.
(minigames
   (cannon
      (gravity 700 (@range 100 2000) (@desc "The cannonball's fall, px/s²"))))
